  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Identification, Investigation and Prosecution of Trafficking in Persons (TIP) in Kazakhstan - Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project is a logical continuation of the previous IOM project implemented with the support of INL/US Embassy in Kazakhstan. The project continues to focus on increasing identification of victims, and investigation and prosecution of trafficking in persons in Kazakhstan through enhanced capacity of law enforcement agencies, law enforcement academies and policy makers.</narrative>
  </description>
